+"""P475 stage 1 (`docs/specs/p475-kv-matrix.md`): the KV-cache format matrix orchestrator.
+
+Per pick x arm x block one leg. Per arm, before its first router leg, the fork's reviewed in-process R7 tool
+(`dev/p369_phase2/qualify.py`, run from the ARM WORKTREE, predictor off) proves the live per-layer cache manifest. Per leg:
+pre-checks (the arm's commit / parent / diff / cleanliness / submodule gitlinks read from the worktree's own git at entry AND
+exit — this module never creates a commit or a worktree —, the arm registry, power, nothing busy, the gate lock, destinations
+absent), a lean router from the arm worktree (`ChainOps`), the worker argv / `KV cache resolved` line / predictor-OFF checks,
+`bench.run_capacity --p475-strict` as the driver (own session / process group) with an independent `bench_watch` bound to its
+pid (power receipt, tick coverage, `pmset -g log`), a receipt on EVERY path, and a harvest to
+`benchmark/results/p475/<leg>/` (scrubbed as `bench.p426_harvest` does). ABBA order, >= 600 s idle (from the end of the
+previous leg's harvest) before every leg, speed-invalid cells re-run from a queue after the planned blocks, a pre-check refusal
+retried after a fresh idle wait up to a bound, an instability rule that adds a deciding third block (reported on its own, with
+its own replacement cap), and the tables generated from the harvested receipts and rows: PER PICK `MATRIX.<pick>.md`
+(exclusive-created as soon as that pick has no gap) and the combined `MATRIX.md` only when both picks are complete. Table
+generation is part of a successful run: a failure, a partial-only output or a table labelled INCOMPLETE exits nonzero.
+A refused arm preflight is retried (`--max-preflight-refusals`) and then recorded as refused; the other arms go on.
+Every dossier is staged and atomically renamed; a receipt without its dossier has its harvest replayed on resume, and resumed
+instability metrics come only from validated harvested dossiers.
+The orchestrator holds an exclusive non-blocking flock on `$STACK_WORKDIR/p475/SEQUENCER.lock` for its lifetime.
+
+  .venv-bench/bin/python -m bench.p475_kv --main-root <main checkout> --workdir $STACK_WORKDIR --out <dir> \
+      --base-commit <P476 sha> --production-ref <ref> [--worktrees-root <dir>] [--smoke] [--picks fable,uniform4] \
+      [--max-replacements 2] [--max-deciding-replacements 2] [--max-not-started 3] [--max-preflight-refusals 2] \
+      [--regenerate-matrix "<why>"]
+  .venv-bench/bin/python -m bench.p475_kv --main-root <main checkout> --workdir $STACK_WORKDIR --out <dir> \
+      --matrix-only [--picks ...] [--regenerate-matrix "<why>"]
+"""
+from __future__ import annotations
+
+import argparse
+import dataclasses
+import fcntl
+import getpass
+import hashlib
+import importlib.util
+import json
+import lzma
+import os
+import re
+import shutil
+import signal
+import socket
+import subprocess
+import sys
+import time
+from dataclasses import dataclass, field
